Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.68,0:00:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.56,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-V-Mon and I decided to\Ntake on Malomyotismon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though the others were afraid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I ever stopped to think about\Nanything, I'd be scared, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Malomyotismon played\Nmind tricks on everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terrifying Ken and making the others\Nbelieve their favorite wish had come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my wish really did come true,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.16,0:01:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because V-Mon digivolved into\Nall his forms at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bad news is that MaloMyotismon's\Nwishes are also coming true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:02:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his wishes could make a\Ngenie crawl back in his bottle!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,0)\fscx125\fscy125\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(321,318)}Our Digital World
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otrago, there's got a lot of gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.18,0:02:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so dark, and it'll be like this\Nforever if we can't stop Malamiotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have too many people depending on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two worlds will unite in darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they shall both be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's never going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we're going to\Nstop you once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your pitiful light is no\Nmatch for my darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now, it consumes the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for long. Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Positron laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screaming darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's all our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the digital world and the real world\Nare going to be covered in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You foolish Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch closely now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your world is being\Nconsumed by Eternal Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you defeat us, others\Nwill rise up against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could possibly beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think any of us have\Na home to go home to anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's no point\Nto anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit talking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, it's all true, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing any of us can do to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing we'll do is fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.48,0:03:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he hasn't. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he will beat us if you give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because things look bad,\Nthere's no reason not to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I do, so quit sitting there like a\Nbunch of zapsacks and let's beat this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already defeated us once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:03:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, it's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In mere moments, both worlds will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness is strong here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but if we want to get back to\Nthe digital world, this is our only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be the only chance for all\Nof us in both worlds, for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't have any idea if\Nthis gate is going to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the gate in Tokyo sealed by Black\NWar and Greymon, this is the closest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he was trying to help\Nus protect the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he may have done more harm\Nthan good if we can't get back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like we have no choice but to\Ngive it a try and hope for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the place where we\Nfirst went to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this had better work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get Noriko to\NOikawa as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what's going to happen\Nto my daughter if you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, she'll be fine.\NBut she'll be okay, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:05:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, we trust you Am I the only one\Nwho's worried we won't be able to save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.22,0:05:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we won't be able to save everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dying of the light and no one to rage
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,against it My power\Nover both of the worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is growing stronger\NAnd now there's nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that can stand against\Nme I don't think so,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,positron laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Force! Justice Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screaming darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do they bother trying to fight him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just nothing that they\Ncan do that will defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should know it's\Nall pointless by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could help if\Nwe were the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we were only chosen by Oikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, we have to get to the digital\Nworld before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess our parents were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the magic word after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could be the end of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.38,0:06:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gates are opening all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's lighting up like a modem\Nrouter in full pulse mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that looks like a Christmas tree\Nlighting up, I'd have to agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the light from the gates is cutting through\NMalomyotismon's blanket of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be coming from Digivices\Nall over the planet. Just think,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,millions of kids are banding together to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take a stand against\NMalomyotismon right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter where they're\Nfrom or what language they speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all knew they had to\Nunite against the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had to fight it no matter how\Nfutile it may have seemed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that Malomyotus Mon\Ncouldn't win that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole world's fighting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.53,0:06:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.84,0:07:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we don't have to feed them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light from the Digivice has guided us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It led us all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.54,0:07:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The partner Digimon and the DigiDestined\Nfrom all over the world are gathering!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't allow you to destroy our worlds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you think you can bully us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, put up your dukes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your meaningless little gathering\Nof buffoons doesn't frighten me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how many of you\Nthere are, you'll never defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screaming Darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to fight it, baby,\Nbut I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here for you, Palmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deramon! Centarumon! Frigimon! Breezomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.90,0:07:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shakkoumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go! Apemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crabmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Floramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yonamon! Whamon! Gokimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotsumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's blinding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light of the Digimon is winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look! In the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That light!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like three years ago,\Nthe gate is opening up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It actually opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean of course it opened
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on Noriko
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.30,0:08:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Noriko? Noriko, where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:09:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter's in the\Nvery best of hands now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can really do right now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.74,0:09:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but believe in the\Nstrength of our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all worked out three\Nyears ago, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But tell me, what's going to\Nhappen if they don't come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't think like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we want them to succeed,\Nwe have to believe in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone must believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our children and the whole\Nworld might depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the Digimon have fallen\Ninto some kind of trance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like Izzy when\Nhe plays video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're absorbing the energy\Nfrom the beams of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like recharging the battery on a laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look who we brought,\NDigidestined from all over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.22,0:10:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought there'd be so many?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gates opened up from all over the\Nworld and they came to help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And each one of them has a partner\NDigimon who wants to help out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bond between the Digidestined\Nand the Digimon opened up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.74,0:10:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were never really meant\Nto be the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we don't have partner\NDigimon like you guys have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.12,0:10:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all of us are tainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still carry the dark\Nspores inside of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of them, the only thing we\Nhave to look forward to is more pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness is returning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, just keep thinking\Nthat way, my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.78,0:10:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys, he's getting stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you\Ndon't have partner Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if\Nyou're not Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need any of that stuff\Nto have a really good life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.40,0:11:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've all got shortcomings to face\Nand problems we wish we didn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't just lie down and\Ngive in to all of your troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't give up when he\Nlearned Oikawa was using him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone has problems, but everyone\Nhas good things going for them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about all your hopes\Nand all of your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they're gone, or been taken away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, could you kids be\Na little more negative?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only person who can take your\Ndreams away is you by giving up on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what's your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I want to open a noodle cart. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's the matter with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make the best noodles\Nin the whole wide world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, I always wanted\Nto be a kindergarten teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:11:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A baseball player.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted a bakery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love the smell of fresh bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to draw comic books, but everyone\Nused to laugh at me, so I gave up on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all had dreams, but somehow\Ngot the idea they were worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we gave up on them when\Nwe shouldn't have, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you can't let other people\Ntalk you out of your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hadn't wasted all\Nthis time by giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's never too late to go\Nout and make your dreams become a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that even kids like\Nus can make our dreams come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.90,0:12:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, you bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so much happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I can do anything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.96,0:12:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can if you believe. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in myself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.14,0:13:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you glad to\Nmeet your partner, Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for believing in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a digivice? For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's hard to believe is how smart\Na handsome guy like me can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These paltry children\Ncan't make me disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't allow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, everybody, use your digivices,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we'll get rid of this\Npesky darkness forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giga Crusher!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We destroyed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Gennai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my tail ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your tail ring was quite an\Nimportant little item, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It kept the dark powers of the Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperor's fortress from\Ngrowing out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it allowed you all to DNA Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since that's not necessary\Nanymore, you get to have it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But do me a little favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No big deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you could keep it\Naway from the power-hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,evil creatures looking to take\Nover and destroy the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.52,0:14:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all seriousness, you truly saved\Nthe world. Thank you. To all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went to another world, too, different\Nthan the real or digital worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that weird place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, it's a world\Nthat can grant people's wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.12,0:14:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, it is the\Npower to grant wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.10,0:15:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the digital world also has some\Nof that power to make dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the digital world is basically a mix of\Ndigital data and people's dreams. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it has the power to bring\Npeople's dark thoughts to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.22,0:15:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the dark spores?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't they all be taken out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we believe in\Nourselves and our dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dark spores will remain\Npowerless against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.14,0:15:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little further, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost in the digital world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I'd had your optimism, I might\Nnot have ended up with such a sad fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was unable to maintain\Nhope through the bad times,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I drowned in my despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I'd had friends like you,\Nor allowed myself to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukio!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.78,0:16:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.22,0:16:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Datirimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Yukio's partner Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oikawa's partner Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little guy's here for you, Oikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting practically forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just been so long\Nsince I've seen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since my happier days with Hiroki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, better late than never.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come into the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is stand up\Nand walk into the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.51,0:16:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may not have the strength, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body was badly damaged by\Nhaving Malomyotismon inside of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he doesn't have\Nmuch time left. But no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:17:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems so rough somehow, unfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of energy was used\Nup to defeat MaloMyotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and as a result, the digital\Nworld itself has been weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.74,0:17:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's going to take\Na lot of hard work to get it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back to the way it used to be\Nbefore all of this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.66,0:17:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of the other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other world?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can use it to make dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body is too weak to go\Non, but I won't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.76,0:17:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be another way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on to your optimism, your dreams,\Nand especially your friends, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps if I had been more like you,\NI could have had adventures, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally made it to the digital world\Nand found your partner Digimon, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Owakawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we just met again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here\Ninside the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oikawa transformed himself\Ninto energy and used
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his life force to revitalize\Nthe digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He restored all of the beauty that was\Nalmost completely destroyed by Malomiodasmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Oikawa's spirit is still there\Nprotecting the digital world forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on already, we have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, we don't want to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,25 years have passed, and\NI've become a novelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm working on a series of books about\Nour adventures in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There have been a lot of big changes\Nin the world, and in us, since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's TK! Hi! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, how are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.70,0:18:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now everyone on the planet knows about the\Ndigital world and has their own partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.23,0:18:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But despite all the changes that contact\Nwith the digital world has brought,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one thing has remained\Nthe same, our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all still get together\Nand those gatherings
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are some of the happiest times of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai and Agumon are diplomats dealing with
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,relations between the\Nreal and digital worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Tai finally cut his hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you wanna play tag? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.62,0:19:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt and Gabumon became an astronaut\Nteam and made it all the way to Mars,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though they were only\Nsupposed to go to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.44,0:19:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now be careful, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how come?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, and I'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora and Biyomon are fashion designers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon says their new\Nline is just to die for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to stay clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, go roll in the mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe's the DigiWorld's first doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad his patients keep\Neating his tongue depressors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now remember to share with the other kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi's cooking show is the only\Ntime she takes off her hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't act like a ram cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.53,0:19:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or a sim chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.45,0:19:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy researches the digi world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and his daughter\Nhave their own language.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to have fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari's a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She actually likes being in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, whatever happens,\Ndon't get all panicky, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Mom, that's what you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli and Ken are married with children,\Nand Ken and Stingmon are detectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Yoli says he can't seem to detect\Nwhen it's his turn to do the dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad, can I sue if I get tagged it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody's a defense attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.82,0:20:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's bought a hundred briefcases\Nbecause Armadimon keeps sitting on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.22,0:20:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad you could finally make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Davis finally\Nopened his noodle cart,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and believe it or not,\Nit became a huge success.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're now Noodle Noodle, come get\Nyour noodle carts all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here\Nstanding with your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go play tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.57,0:20:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go show what my tag's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.26,0:20:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can see we're\Nstill having adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just a little different than the\Nones we used to have when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.20,0:20:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness has not been conquered,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it will continue to fight\Nagainst the light forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as long as people remember to follow\Ntheir dreams, evil will be kept at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.52,0:21:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And on days like today, it's hard\Nto see any darkness anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's up to our children and to\Nchildren everywhere to follow their dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows where they'll end up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the only way to find out is to\Ntake that first step into adventure.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.09,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.60,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.02,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to run together with my\Nhands, and I'm going to run together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you give a big strength?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.16,0:22:03.21,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.21,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.22,0:22:17.10,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.10,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.99,0:22:40.04,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1030,1000)\c&HF1F2F0&\3c&H1E1E1E&\pos(318,337)}Fin

